{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最近，在下做了一个重要的职业转型决定，准备从稳定的行业跳到一个充满未知的新领域。在做出这个决定之前，已经做了大量的市场调研和自我评估，认为这是实现个人价值的最佳路径。

然而，当在下把这个想法告诉家人和朋友时，几乎所有人都表示不理解甚至强烈反对，他们认为我放弃了已有的优势，选择了一条风险极高的路，甚至有人质疑能力。面对这些铺天盖地的反对声，在下内心也开始动摇，甚至怀疑自己是不是过于理想化了。尽管如此，内心深处那个声音却一直告诉我这是对的。这种被所有人质疑的感觉真的很不好受。想问问大家，应该如何审视判断？坚持独立判断，如果遭遇不同意的声音，要做些什么？

坚持意味着什么呢？如果结果不好就是错误，在下也会动摇，可是这等价于只要预期不良/声势浩大就会动摇，预期不良/声势浩大而不动摇的行为，好像想象不到。见识到了答主打疫情、俄乌、蔚来、西贝等等大逆风局，非常钦佩，是如何坚持呢？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"周围所有亲人、爱人普遍的甚至是铁板一块的不赞同你时，建议你将之视为“确实不能做”的信号，暂时搁置你的打算。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们是你身边最亲近的人，你的计划引起了这么多亲人的焦虑，有很大可能是ta们以自己对你的观察，对你能经受住其中某些环节的考验有很大的顾虑。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而在这个问题上，ta们很可能是比你本人更有效的判断者。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"换一个角度，家人是你执行复杂计划最重要的支撑，如果ta们过于忧虑而你强行上马，对ta们会是很大的情绪挑战和折磨；如果ta们在途中出问题，对你的计划执行也会是一个巨大的阻碍，更会令你原本考虑好的计划变得不够可靠。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这跟我“打逆风局”是不同的，因为我的“逆风局”不涉及什么具体执行，仅仅只是就事论事、以据辩理，而且主要是为认为受误解、受损害的一方提供声援和帮助，为深受形势拉扯而倍感焦虑的你们给出我能给予的服务。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这跟你尝试进行职业转型的性质是不同的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是朝着对手，为保护我所爱的而战；而你是为挣脱爱你的，为你自己的执念而战啊。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是的，执念。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我始终有一个信念——爱我的人必然是真诚为我考虑的，如果这个世界上有人有权挡在我和我的欲求之间，让我心甘情愿的搁置我的打算，那就必然是ta们。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"如果阻拦我的是敌人、是路人，那么这是我的意志是否坚定的问题，甚至恰恰是敌人阻拦我，我反而越视为升帆、加油的信号。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"但阻拦我的是曾为我牺牲、受屈的亲人、爱人，那么只要我不能让ta们灵魂安宁、信心安定的支持，我就视为是上天在通过ta们告诉我“还不行”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不是“永远不行”“绝对不行”，而是“还不行”“这样不行”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我若是仍然想做，我就修订我的方案，花费更多的时间，寻求ta们的认可。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们是爱我的，天然就有乐于自我牺牲成全我的打算，这是什么意思？意思是ta们作为主考官，会放水放到连公式到底通不通都不核算，仅仅看我证明得十分用功、冷静、诚恳，就会放我过关。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而如果在这么好考的考官手里我都拿不到及格，如果我连ta们也不能扎扎实实的说服、安抚，我的计划只能被视为是真的不够成熟的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而因此耽误的机会、错过的时间，也就不可以被视为是被这些亲人、爱人耽误，而只能被视为是被计划不够周全、机缘不够成熟而耽误。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我也可以因此单纯而固执的坚信被耽误一定是最好的结果、相信我如果硬干一定会比不干更糟糕——哪怕有一个和我看起来差不多的人干了并且结果令人羡慕，也一定是“我不是ta，我来干肯定完蛋”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，你就安下心来，好好的去说服吧。你会发现，其实ta们是被你那个“如果不能好好说服你们，我宁可不做”的心甘情愿的态度说服的，而不是你的数学公式和市场分析。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而证明你这个态度的最好证据，就是你会愿意不断的调整你的方案，不断的降低预期风险——例如缩小前期投入规模。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要你确信ta们是真心实意爱你的，你就要力求争取这些世上最好争取的人的祝福，明白吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为如果连这条线也抹去，世上就没有“一意孤行”这个概念了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}
